msgid "Play %s"
msgstr "Ɣer %s"

msgid "About"
msgstr "Ɣef"

msgid "Connecting..."
msgstr "Tuqqna..."

msgid "Main Menu"
msgstr "Umuɣ agejdan"

msgid "Quit"
msgstr "Ffeɣ"

msgid "Keyboard Shortcuts"
msgstr "Inegzumen n unasiw"

msgid "General"
msgstr "Amatu"

msgid "Playback"
msgstr "Taɣuri"

msgid "Volume"
msgstr "Aswir n ṣṣut"

msgid "Play or pause"
msgstr "Ɣer neɣ seḥbes kra"

msgid "Stop playback"
msgstr "Seḥbes taɣuri"

msgid "Copy current track"
msgstr "Nɣel tizlit tamirant"

msgid "Stations"
msgstr "Tiɣatin"

msgid "Play J-POP"
msgstr "Ɣer J-POP"

msgid "Play K-POP"
msgstr "Ɣer K-POP"

msgid "Previous station"
msgstr "Taɣa yezrin"

msgid "Next station"
msgstr "Taɣa i d-iteddun"

msgid "Window"
msgstr "Asfaylu"

msgid "Open preferences"
msgstr "Ldi ismenyifen"

msgid "Show shortcuts"
msgstr "Sken inegzumen"

msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "Ismenyifen"

msgid "Startup Defaults"
msgstr "Iɣewwaren n tazwara"

msgid "Experimental Features"
msgstr "Timahilin tirmitanin"

msgid "Default station"
msgstr "Taɣa tamezwert"

msgid "J-POP"
msgstr "J-POP"

msgid "K-POP"
msgstr "K-POP"

msgid "Autoplay"
msgstr "Taɣuri tawurmant"

msgid "Start playing automatically on launch"
msgstr "Bdu taɣuri s wudem awurman deg usenker"

msgid "Enable pause and resume"
msgstr "Rmed aseḥbes d uɣal ɣer tɣuri"

msgid "Use pause and resume for the main playback button"
msgstr "Seqdec aseḥbes d uɣal ɣer tɣuri i tqeffalt tagejdant n tɣuri"

msgid "Discord Rich Presence"
msgstr "Discord Rich Presence"

msgid "Enable Discord Rich Presence at runtime"
msgstr "Rmed Discord Rich Presence deg uselkem"

msgid "It is time to ditch other radios. Stream and metadata provided by LISTEN.moe."
msgstr "D akud ad tbeddleḍ ṛṛadyu. Asuddem d yiɣefisefka ttunefken-d sɣur LISTEN.moe."

msgid "J-POP and K-POP radio"
msgstr "Ṛṛadyu J-POP d K-POP"

msgid "Listen to J-POP and K-POP"
msgstr "Sel i J-POP d K-POP"

msgid "Pause and resume the live stream"
msgstr "Seḥbes kra sakin kemmel asuddem usrid"

msgid "Animated sound bars that react to the music"
msgstr "Tifeggagin n ṣṣut yettembiwilen s uẓawan"

msgid "Dynamic colors based on the current album or artist cover"
msgstr "Initen yettbeddilen ilmend n tugna n walbum neɣ n unaẓur amiran"

msgid "No ads"
msgstr "Ulac adellel"

msgid "Initial release."
msgstr "Lqem amezwaru."

msgid "When connected and there is no album or artist image"
msgstr "Mi ara teqqneḍ yerna ulac tugna n walbum neɣ n unaẓur"

msgid "Colored window when connected"
msgstr "Asfaylu s yiniten mi ara teqqneḍ"

msgid "AI translation (GPT-5.2); reviewed by nobody"
msgstr "AI translation (Codex); not human-reviewed"

msgid "This release focuses on visuals and localization."
msgstr "Lqem-a yerra lwelha ɣer udem d tsuqilt."

msgid "Fine-tuned dark/light mode detection so light colors are no longer mistaken for dark ones."
msgstr "Tifin n uskar aberkan/aceɛlal tettusnerna akken initen iceɛlalen ur ttwaḥsaben ara d iberkanen."

msgid "Polished translations and improved how they are applied."
msgstr "Tisuqilin d useqdec-nsent ttusnernant."

msgid "Removed gaps between sound bars."
msgstr "Tallunin gar tfeggagin n ṣṣut ttwakksent."

msgid "Streaming logic now better handles connection issues and stream changes."
msgstr "Asuddem yessefray tura ugar uguren n tuqqna d yibeddilen n usuddem."

msgid "Clarified the application description."
msgstr "Aglam n usnas yettwasegza ugar."

msgid "Translated image captions"
msgstr "Inumalen n tugniwin ttusuqlen"

msgid "Updated screenshots to use a more reasonable window size"
msgstr "Tuṭṭfiwin n ugdil ttuleqqment s teɣzi n usfaylu iwulmen ugar"

msgid "Updated application icon"
msgstr "Tignit n usnas tettuleqqem"

msgid "Display the application icon in media controls."
msgstr "Sken tignit n usnas deg yisenqaden n wallalen n teywalt."

msgid "Optional Discord activity sharing"
msgstr "Beṭṭu n urmud ɣef Discord s lebɣi-k"

msgid "Added Discord activity sharing."
msgstr "Yettwarna beṭṭu n urmud ɣef Discord."

msgid "Reconnect to Discord instead of disabling this feature."
msgstr "Tuqqna tikelt nniḍen ɣer Discord deg umḍiq n usensi n tmahilt-a."

msgid "Added flags to control pause behavior, autoplay, or disable Discord integration."
msgstr "Ttwarnan iɣewwaren i useḥbes, tɣuri tawurmant neɣ usensi n usdukkel n Discord."

msgid "Fixed an issue where paused playback resumed during a network disruption."
msgstr "Yettuseɣti ugur anda taɣuri yettwaḥebsen tettkemmil deg ugzam n uẓeṭṭa."

msgid "Added preferences and keyboard shortcuts."
msgstr "Ttwarnan ismenyifen d yinegzumen n unasiw."

msgid "Changed pause, resume, and station switching behavior."
msgstr "Yettwabeddel tikli n useḥbes, uɣal ɣer tɣuri d ubeddel n tɣa."

msgid "Added startup options for pause/resume or stop behavior, with play/stop now the default."
msgstr "Ttwarnan iɣewwaren n usenker i useḥbes/uɣal neɣ aḥbas, s tɣuri/uḥbas d amezwer."

msgid "Check for updates"
msgstr "Nadi ileqman"

msgid "Cancel update"
msgstr "Sefsex aleqqem"

msgid "Couldn't check for updates"
msgstr "Ur yezmir ara ad inadi ileqman"

msgid "Try again later."
msgstr "Ɛreḍ tikelt nniḍen ticki."

msgid "Already up to date"
msgstr "Yettuleqqem yakan"

msgid "You have the latest version of Listen Moe."
msgstr "Tesɛiḍ lqem aneggaru n Listen Moe."

msgid "The release metadata is missing a valid SHA-256 digest."
msgstr "Ixuṣ uḍris n usenqed SHA-256 ameɣtu deg yiɣefisefka n lqem."

msgid "Couldn't download the update"
msgstr "Ur yezmir ara ad d-isader aleqqem"

msgid "Update canceled"
msgstr "Aleqqem yettwasefsex"

msgid "The update was canceled."
msgstr "Aleqqem yettwasefsex."

msgid "The update check was canceled."
msgstr "Anadi n yileqman yettwasefsex."

msgid "The downloaded installer will not be installed."
msgstr "Assebdad i d-yettwasadren ur yettwasebdad ara."

msgid "Installing update"
msgstr "Asebded n uleqqem"

msgid "Listen Moe will close."
msgstr "Listen Moe ad yemdel."

msgid "Couldn't install the update"
msgstr "Ur yezmir ara ad isebded aleqqem"

msgid "Checking for updates"
msgstr "Anadi n yileqman"

msgid "Downloading update"
msgstr "Asader n uleqqem"

msgid "Update ready"
msgstr "Aleqqem yewjed"

msgid "Version"
msgstr "Lqem"

msgid "Downloaded"
msgstr "Yettwasader"

msgid "Looking for a newer Windows installer on GitHub Releases."
msgstr "Anadi n usebdad Windows amaynut ugar ɣef GitHub Releases."

msgid "A newer Windows release is available."
msgstr "Yella lqem Windows amaynut ugar."

msgid "The installer is ready to run."
msgstr "Assebdad yewjed i uselkem."

msgid "Couldn't start the installer."
msgstr "Ur yezmir ara ad isenker assebdad."

msgid "Removed pause/resume from stable builds."
msgstr "Aseḥbes/uɣal yettwakkes seg yileqman urkidin."

msgid "Separate experimental features from stable features."
msgstr "Bḍu timahilin tirmitanin ɣef tmahilin turkidin."

msgid "Volume control added."
msgstr "Yettwarna usenqed n uswir n ṣṣut."

msgid "Karaoke"
msgstr "Karaoke"

msgid "Show karaoke"
msgstr "Sken karaoke"

msgid "Finding lyrics…"
msgstr "Anadi n wawalen n tezlit…"

msgid "Just a moment"
msgstr "Rǧu kra"

msgid "No synchronized lyrics"
msgstr "Ulac awalen n tezlit yemṣadan"

msgid "This song can still be your tiny concert."
msgstr "Tizlit-a tezmer mazal ad tili d tameɣra-inek tameẓẓyant."

msgid "Couldn't load lyrics"
msgstr "Ur yezmir ara ad d-isali awalen n tezlit"

msgid "Try again in a moment."
msgstr "Ɛreḍ tikelt nniḍen deffir kra."

msgid "Lyrics by LRCLIB"
msgstr "Awalen n tezlit sɣur LRCLIB"

msgid "Added lyrics."
msgstr "Ttwarnan wawalen n tezlit."

msgid "Added a song progress bar."
msgstr "Tettwarna tfeggagt n usfari n tezlit."

msgid "Long artist and song names scroll smoothly."
msgstr "Ismawen ɣezzifen n yinaẓuren d tezlatin tteddun s sshala."

msgid "Hover over the title to see the full text."
msgstr "Sɛeddi taɣerdayt ɣef uzwel akken ad twaliḍ aḍris ummid."

msgid "Scrolling text and background animations respect Reduce Motion."
msgstr "Aḍris yettembiwilen d usmussu n ugilal ṭṭafaṛen aɣewwar n usenqes n umbiwel."
